@*
    Spec 027 / US6 / FR-018 — `_RequiredMark` partial.

    The single shared required-field marker. Renders an asterisk with an
    es-CR aria-label so screen readers announce the field as obligatorio.
    Place immediately after a required field's <label> text:

        <label class="form-label" asp-for="Foo">
            Foo @await Html.PartialAsync("_RequiredMark")
        </label>

    Optional fields render no marker. Replaces the ad-hoc
    `<span class="text-danger" aria-label="campo obligatorio">*</span>`
    scattered across the forms (research D5).
*@
<span class="text-danger" aria-label="campo obligatorio">*</span>
